msgstr "Approximate view of how it will look:"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/table
#: form.rst:464
msgid ""
"Для произвольной логики на бэкенде в Citeck есть возможность создания "
"дополнительных микросервисов. Демо микросервис, который можно посмотреть "
"для примера -  https://github.com/Citeck/ecos-demo-app"
msgstr ""
"For custom backend logic in Citeck, there is an option to create "
"additional microservices. A demo microservice that can be viewed as an "
"example - https://github.com/Citeck/ecos-demo-app"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/table
#: form.rst:467
msgid "Изменение стиля строки"
msgstr "Changing row style"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/table
#: form.rst:473
msgid ""
"У каждой строки можно заполнять флаг \"совпадения\" и повесить на этот "
"атрибут :ref:`форматтер<formatters>`"
msgstr ""
"For each row, you can fill the \"match\" flag and attach a "
":ref:`formatter<formatters>` to this attribute"

#: ../../settings_kb/interface/forms/form_components/components/table
#: form.rst:475
msgid ""
"Пример формы :download:`excel-files-inport-form.json <../files/excel-"
"files-inport-form_1.json>`"
msgstr ""
"Example form :download:`excel-files-inport-form.json <../files/excel-"
"files-inport-form_1.json>`"

